The code works by:
1.Run it
2.it will ask for input for how many packages there are
3.then ask for input for the weight of the packages 
4.then it will tell you if it can carry it or not

I have made it by adding the motors which to show how many motors are stored in the packages
packageWeight is to tell how much the packages weigh
avgWeight is to calculate the average weight of the motors
maxLoad is the constant weight of the motors

Then it puts printf in and then scanf for input from the user to tell how many packages and the weight of the packages
